<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26830" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διϊκνέομαι</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίξομαι</span>: aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ικόμην</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>go through, penetrate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτὶ τὰν ψυχάν δι᾽ ὤτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ti.Locr.
					101a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφ᾽ ὅσον -εῖται τὸ ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					3.20.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διῖκτο ἡ δόξα μέχρι βασιλέως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Dem.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				12.35
			</span></i>; <i>reach,</i> with missiles, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.79
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βραδέως τοῦ παραγγέλματος διικνουμένου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Nic.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in speaking,
				<i>go through, tell of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντα δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.61
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				19.186
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.411
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of Time,
				<i>intervene,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διετοῦς χρόνου διικνουμένου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longus
					1.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
